<title>USA: BOK Financial Corp Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>BOK Financial Corp Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.87		    $0.68</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.60		    $0.53</p>
<p> Net			 14,566		   12,663</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	21,370		   21,192</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	24,219		   24,006</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>		  YEAR</p>
