<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 year results include non-recurring charges of $7.6 million resulting from federal legislative action to recapitalize the Savings Association Insurance Fund and from the writeoff of core deposit intangible assets related to SAIF-insured deposits taken in earlier quarters.</p>
<p>Assets $4.62 billion vs $4.24 billion</p>
